label Greeting
KuyaKap: A new face! Have I seen you before, young man?
- Woah, you're very tall.
- Nope, I just got here... also, you're very tall.

KuyaKap: Haha, this must be the first time you've seen me. [pause=0.4] I'm Kuya Kap, the resident bystander [wave amp=30 freq=5]Kapre[/wave].
- I've only heard the stories about the Kapre.
	KuyaKap: I hope they're not too evil.
- A what?
	KuyaKap: The [wave amp=30 freq=5]Kapre[/wave], [wave amp=50 freq=3]evil spirits[/wave] who devour lost intruders, ring a bell? [pause=0.6] Kidding!

KuyaKap: Many stories spread around my kind, but as long as our trees breathe and our territories are respected, you won't need to worry.
- Haha! Well that's reassuring.

KuyaKap: Anyway, let me buy [pulse freq=2.0]{Transaction.ItemWants}[/pulse]. I need to relax a bit.
- Coming right up!
[end_timeline]

label Talk
KuyaKap: [pulse freq=2.0]{Transaction.ItemWants}[/pulse] pa rin please!
- Sige, antayin lang.
	KuyaKap: Sige sige, mag-aabang na lang ako.
	[end_timeline]
- Pasensya na, hindi kita maseserbisyuhan ngayon.
	KuyaKap: Nako, ganon ba? Sige, aalis na ako.
	[signal arg="refuse_service"]
	[end_timeline]

label Satisfy
KuyaKap: Salamat. I'll be bystanding here for a while, don't mind me.
[end_timeline]

label WrongItem
KuyaKap: Di 'yan yung item ah. [pulse freq=2.0]{Transaction.ItemWants}[/pulse] 'yung hinihingi ko.
- Ay sorry Kuya, sandali.
	KuyaKap: Okay lang, mag-hihintay ako.
	[end_timeline]
- Pasensya na Kuya, hindi available.
	KuyaKap: Aw, okay sige. Bukas na lang.
	[signal arg="refuse_service"]
	[end_timeline]

label Rejected
KuyaKap: Sige na lang, hindi naman kailangan. Salamat pa rin.
[end_timeline]
